    "nutrition": null,
    "directions": [
      "In a mortar pestle, add green chillies, ginger, salt to taste and grind it into coarse paste. Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a handi, add mustard oil, once it’s smoky hot, add fenugreek seeds, fennel seeds, cumin seeds, nigella seeds, small mustard seeds, prepared ginger green chilli paste and saute it for a minute.",
      "Add potatoes, give it a good mix and cover it with a lid and cook it for 7-8 minutes on medium flames.",
      "Add prepared curd mixture and cook it for a while until oil is separated from the masala.",
      "Add raw mangoes, water, jaggery and simmer it for another 5-6 minutes.",
      "Finish it with salt to taste, jaggery and mix it well.",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish, garnish it with green chillies, ginger and coriander sprig.",
      "Serve hot with roti.",
      "In a bowl, add water, curd, turmeric powder, degi red chili powder, coriander powder, a pinch of asafoetida and give it a good mix. Keep it aside for further use."
    ],
